<title>USA: Hasbro wraps up Russ Berrie units takeover.</title>
<headline>Hasbro wraps up Russ Berrie units takeover.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hasbro Inc said Friday it completed a deal to acquire the Cap Toys Inc and OddzOn Products Inc units of Russ Berrie and Co Inc for $166 million.</p>
<p>Cap Toys sells a variety dolls, novelty toys and &quot;interactive&quot; candy dispensers. OddzOn sells the Koosh brand balls, which features Disney and Looney Tunes characters.</p>
<p>Hasbro's toy products include the Playskool, Kenner, Tonka, Milton Bradley, Parker Brothers and Hasbro Interactive brands.</p>
</text>
